  m_text: 'THE END








    - Credits -

    A game by Odin, Olaf, Ragnar and
    Veronica


    Idea - Olaf


    Narrative - Odin, Olaf, Ragnar, Veronica


    Human
    Resources - Veronica


    GDD  - Veronica


    Sounds - Odin, Olaf


    UI
    - Olaf, Veronica


    Project Management - Veronica


    Game code - Olaf


    In
    engine work - Olaf


    Fmod - Odin, Olaf


    Entertainment System - Olaf


    Magazine
    and crossword code - Ragnar








    We hope you enjoyed the experience. Remember
    to treat everyone with love and respect, and let''s enjoy our time here together.'
